### Media Video - Get all playlists
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house-media/api/{{apiVersion}}/media/video/playlists

### Media Video - Get specific playlist
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house-media/api/{{apiVersion}}/media/video/playlist?path={{path}}

### Media Video - Get invalid playlist path (Expect 404)
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house-media/api/{{apiVersion}}/media/video/playlist?path={{invalidPath}}

### Media Commons - Set log level to TRACE
PUT {{SERVER}}/kame-house-media/api/{{apiVersion}}/commons/log-level/trace
